<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstround results at</p>
<p>the $450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 6-0</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
</text>
